WEBVTT

00:06:29.424 --> 00:06:31.448
And then it starts to sound like this:

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:34.952
"Dating in my 20s was like musical chairs.

00:06:34.976 --> 00:06:37.821
Everybody was running around
and having fun,

00:06:37.845 --> 00:06:40.701
but then sometime around 30
it was like the music turned off

00:06:40.725 --> 00:06:42.608
and everybody started sitting down.

00:06:43.235 --> 00:06:45.584
I didn't want to be
the only one left standing up,

00:06:45.608 --> 00:06:47.625
so sometimes I think I married my husband

00:06:47.649 --> 00:06:50.147
because he was the closest
chair to me at 30."

00:06:51.381 --> 00:06:53.174
Where are the twentysomethings here?

00:06:53.198 --> 00:06:55.277
Do not do that.

00:06:55.565 --> 00:06:57.279
(Laughter)

00:06:57.418 --> 00:07:00.518
Okay, now that sounds a little flip,
but make no mistake,